sequenceDiagram
  actor P as User
  participant W as Web App
  participant R as AuthRoutes
  participant S as AuthService
  participant T as TokenService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  P->>W: Enter email/username + password
  W->>R: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  R->>R: validate(loginSchema)
  R->>S: login(identifier, password)
  S->>DB: find user by email or username
  alt user not found or wrong password
    S-->>W: 401 Invalid email/username or password
  else account deactivated
    S-->>W: 403 Account has been deactivated
  else valid
    S->>T: generateAuthTokens(user)
    T->>DB: insert auth_tokens (refresh, hashed)
    T-->>S: access + refresh token
    S-->>W: 200 user + tokens
    W->>P: Redirect to role home
  end
